    {
      "id": "claim_76aa41f5d14641fb9c531bfc37f49af9",
      "statement": "The flux-local diff job runs a matrix over helmrelease and kustomization resources, diffs the PR branch against the default branch with noise-stripping attributes (helm.sh/chart, checksum/config, app.kubernetes.io/version, chart), and posts the resulting patch as a PR comment; the comment step has continue-on-error so a failed comment does not fail the job.",
